{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/478381-sybaris-and-supernaturals","id":478381,"title":"Sybaris and Supernaturals","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mummy: The Curse"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-04-12T15:46:17-07:00","id":478381,"title":"Sybaris and Supernaturals","content":"The rules say that other supernatural beings experience only 'a shadow' of a Mummy's Sybaris, but don't go into any real description of what it feels like. Anyone have any ideas?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/665-shkspr1048","name":"shkspr1048","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"630"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-12T15:53:40-07:00","id":478397,"title":"","content":"Creeping dread and a sense of impermanency. It'd be worse for those who are not immortal, as they suffer a sense of insignificance before the weight of eternity. They probably suffer visions of the Mummy's Sybaris form, and smells like that of old, sand-filled tombs.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1059-azahul","name":"Azahul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-12T16:30:57-07:00","id":478419,"title":"","content":"I read it pretty much as an invitation towards roleplay, but specifying that for other supernatural beings it doesn't go so far as to compel their behavior or any given response. The feeling is probably more akin to a weaker form of the Unease than the Terror; a sixth sense that the mummy represents something significant, something wrong, and a momentary awareness of the weight of eternity. Low-level enough that it can be explained away as just a strange mood or an odd atmosphere; those happen, and supernatural beings are probably particularly prone to them.<br /> <br /> Enchanters on the Path of Thorns probably feel the wave in the ocean of fate a whole lot more, as an example of how different beings might react differently. Some might see that as a sign to stay clear; more probably see an invitation to investigate. All recognize it as a warning: proceed with caution, stormy seas ahead.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-13T10:57:33-07:00","id":479270,"title":"","content":"Supernaturals do the equivalent of counting your fingers after the snapping turtle bites in your direction - you don't really think you've lost one, but you need to check anyway. They've felt the weight of Duat, and Fate, and old powers working in their midst - they don't cave like humans, but they do feel the need to stop, feel their own supernature, and reassure themselves that it's still there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}